This is the Zeppeli family spirit,

257
00:17:03,220 --> 00:17:06,660
handed down from the past to
ensure the family's future.

258
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:09,160
It's the human spirit.

259
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:16,690
Jojo!

260
00:17:16,773 --> 00:17:18,500
This is the last of my hormones!

261
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:21,340
Take it from me!

262
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,980
Take it from me!

263
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:30,940
Did you hear that?

264
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:33,280
It sounded like Caesar screaming!

265
00:17:33,460 --> 00:17:34,401
Yes, I heard it!

266
00:17:34,620 --> 00:17:36,060
Oh no, Caesar can't!

267
00:17:38,740 --> 00:17:39,570
Caesar!

268
00:17:54,620 --> 00:17:56,600
He made a bubble from his blood.

269
00:17:57,880 --> 00:18:01,380
He must have used every last
bit of his Hamon to make it.

270
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,780
Before he died,

271
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:08,435
he saved it for his friends, rather
than using it to try and destroy me.

272
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:19,680
I let it go, but not because
I'm sentimental about him.

273
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:23,680
His talent as a fighter was undeniable.

274
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:27,157
He has my deep respect
as a fellow warrior.

275
00:18:27,240 --> 00:18:32,860
I will hold you in the last moments we
spent together forever in my memory, Caesar.

276
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:39,760
A man as splendid and as fleeting
as the bubbles he conjured.

277
00:18:51,740 --> 00:18:53,017
The place is a wreck.

278
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:55,857
A divine sandstorm did all this!

279
00:18:55,940 --> 00:18:57,617
And Caesar was caught.

280
00:18:57,700 --> 00:18:59,037
Right inside the heart of it.

281
00:18:59,120 --> 00:19:04,760
A bubble.

282
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,777
Could it be?

283
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:09,420
Look at that.

284
00:19:11,520 --> 00:19:13,857
Inside is Caesar's bandana.

285
00:19:13,940 --> 00:19:15,957
Also, a ring.

286
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:17,960
Wamuu's lip ring.

287
00:19:21,700 --> 00:19:24,937
This hormone energy feels really strange.

288
00:19:25,020 --> 00:19:26,180
Whoa!

289
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:36,770
You know,

290
00:19:36,853 --> 00:19:38,997
I haven't been able to
bring myself to call

291
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:42,139
Caesar's name since we made
our way into this place.

292
00:19:43,260 --> 00:19:46,160
It's because I'm afraid
there'll be no answer.

293
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:51,641
If I came in here and cried out his name,
there might not be any response in return.

294
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:54,766
There might be nothing
but a lifeless silence.

295
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:56,473
That is what scares me.

296
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:59,860
I couldn't accept it, so
I didn't call his name.

297
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:03,360
But now, I know he's gone.

298
00:20:04,140 --> 00:20:08,375
The halmon contained in that bubble
told me everything I needed to know.

299
00:20:10,620 --> 00:20:14,560
Right here, just a few
moments ago, Caesar died.

300
00:20:16,100 --> 00:20:17,420
Caesar, you bastard!

301
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:20,937
You had to be a damn show-off
right up until the very end!

302
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:24,079
And then you leave a precious
gift like this for me.

303
00:20:25,460 --> 00:20:26,290
Caesar!

304
00:20:26,540 --> 00:20:27,497
Where are you?

305
00:20:27,580 --> 00:20:29,462
Where the hell are you sleeping?

306
00:20:29,800 --> 00:20:31,200
I'll find you, Caesar!

307
00:20:31,420 --> 00:20:33,260
I'll pick you up! Caesar!

308
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:35,690
Jojo!

309
00:20:35,773 --> 00:20:37,620
This isn't the time to search or grieve.

310
00:20:37,760 --> 00:20:39,540
We have work to do. What?

311
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,118
There are two of them and two of us.

312
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:43,517
The numbers are balanced.

313
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:44,430
They're even.

314
00:20:45,780 --> 00:20:48,177
That trail of blood leading up the stairs

315
00:20:48,260 --> 00:20:51,500
tells me that Caesar
significantly wounded Wamu.

316
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:54,474
We're in the middle of enemy territory.

317
00:20:54,680 --> 00:20:56,580
Let's go finish this fight.

318
00:20:57,700 --> 00:20:59,000
Jojo, come on.

319
00:20:59,260 --> 00:21:00,600
Take the antidote.

320
00:21:00,760 --> 00:21:03,100
Then we'll go hunt those bastards down.

321
00:21:03,640 --> 00:21:04,897
That heartless...

322
00:21:04,980 --> 00:21:08,260
She can't even manage to shed
a single tear for Caesar!

323
00:21:17,720 --> 00:21:20,577
Coach Lisa Lisa, your cigarette.

324
00:21:20,660 --> 00:21:22,000
It's backwards.

325
00:21:27,060 --> 00:21:31,500
Lisa Lisa is our coach, so she
always has to keep a cool exterior.

326
00:21:32,020 --> 00:21:35,420
I know she wants to cry,
much more than I do.

327
00:21:35,880 --> 00:21:40,056
He treated her like a goddess, and
knew her longer than I've known her.

328
00:21:42,420 --> 00:21:45,320
I have to try and hold my feelings back.

329
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:53,101
Caesar, I know you always thought
I was impulsive and self-centered

330
00:21:53,500 --> 00:21:57,340
But sometimes I do understand
the feelings of those around me

331
00:21:57,980 --> 00:21:59,820
I might finally be learning

332
00:22:00,900 --> 00:22:01,800
I swear,

333
00:22:02,040 --> 00:22:03,717
I will fight them both
like the devil until

334
00:22:03,800 --> 00:22:06,377
there's nothing left of
them I'll avenge you,

335
00:22:06,460 --> 00:22:08,540
Caesar Your spirit is with me

336
00:22:17,480 --> 00:22:18,660
Blood.

337
00:22:19,060 --> 00:22:19,937
His blood.

338
00:22:20,020 --> 00:22:22,817
This is where he fell.

339
00:22:22,900 --> 00:22:23,780
Caesar.

340
00:22:31,180 --> 00:22:32,360
Caesar.

341
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,860
Caesar!

342
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,697
They were deep in enemy territory.

343
00:22:43,780 --> 00:22:49,600
Cars and Wamu were very nearby, but the
two simply couldn't help themselves.

344
00:22:50,860 --> 00:22:52,720
Jojo called out Caesar's name.

345
00:22:54,500 --> 00:22:56,477
Lisa Lisa's tears flowed freely,

346
00:22:56,560 --> 00:23:02,720
but their heartbroken cries of grief
were answered only by a cold silence.

347
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:05,880
Caesar was gone.

348
00:23:06,760 --> 00:23:11,877
As they mourned him, they took
solace in one simple fact.

349
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:17,880
Though his body had died, his
soul would live on through them.

350
00:23:19,180 --> 00:23:21,620
Rest in peace, Caesar Zeppeli.

351
00:23:40,220 --> 00:23:43,937
In and around the lake.

352
00:23:44,020 --> 00:23:47,017
Mountains come out of the sky.

353
00:23:47,100 --> 00:23:49,420
They stand there.

354
00:23:51,060 --> 00:23:53,397
24 before my love!

355
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,300
I'll be there.

356
00:24:58,660 --> 00:25:00,717
You're really not impressing me.

357
00:25:00,800 --> 00:25:02,437
I'm going to hug you to death.

358
00:25:02,520 --> 00:25:05,337
We fight tonight under the full moon!

359
00:25:05,420 --> 00:25:07,077
You have no tomorrow.

360
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:09,454
We'll face this fight together, Caesar?
